docs {
  Mirrors scripts/src/live-location-proof.ts:150 and the readiness probe
  run-live-lanes.sh:239 waits on. Returns the Traccar version - the image is
  deliberately unpinned (traccar/traccar:latest), so record the version this
  returns whenever a result depends on it.
}
